            %h6#proof_5 Proof
            %p
              This is an immediate consequence of the fact that over paracompact Hausdorff spaces isomorphism classes of topological vector bundles are homotopy invariant (
              %a{:href => "topological+vector+bundle#HomotopyInvarianceOfIsomorphismClassesOfVectorBundles"}> this example.
              )
          %h3#ExactSequences Exact sequences
          %p
            We discuss the
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/long+exact+sequences+in+cohomology"} long exact sequences in cohomology
            for topological K-theory.
          %p
            What makes these work in prop.
            %a.maruku-ref{:href => "#ExactSequenceInReducedTopologicalKTheory"}
            below, turns out to be the following property of
            = succeed ":" do
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/topological+vector+bundles"} topological vector bundles
          #VectorBundleOnClosedSubsetOfCompactHausdorffSpaceIsPullbackOfBundeOnQuotientSpace.num_lemma
            %h6#lemma_2 Lemma
            %p
              %strong
                (
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/topological+vector+bundle"} topological vector bundle
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/trivial+vector+bundle"} trivial
                over
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/closed+subspace"} closed subspace
                of
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/compact+Hausdorff+space"} compact Hausdorff space
                is
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/pullback+bundle"} pullback
                of bundle on
                = succeed ")" do
                  %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/quotient+space"} quotient space
            %p
              Let
              %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "inline", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
                %semantics
                  %mrow
                    %mi X
                  %annotation{:encoding => "application/x-tex"} X
              be a
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/compact+Hausdorff+space"} compact Hausdorff space
              and let
              %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "inline", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
                %semantics
                  %mrow
                    %mi A
                    %mo ⊂
                    %mi X
                  %annotation{:encoding => "application/x-tex"} A \subset X
              be a
              = succeed "." do
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/closed+subspace"} closed subspace
            %p
              If a
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/topological+vector+bundle"} topological vector bundle
              %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "inline", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
                %semantics
                  %mrow
                    %mi E
                    %mover
                      %mo →
                      %mi p
                    %mi X
                  %annotation{:encoding => "application/x-tex"} E \overset{p}{\to} X
              is such that its restriction
              %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "inline", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
                %semantics
                  %mrow
                    %mi E
                    %msub
                      %mo{:stretchy => "false"} |
                      %mi A
                  %annotation{:encoding => "application/x-tex"} E\vert_A
              is
              = succeed "," do
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/trivializable+vector+bundle"} trivializable
              %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "inline", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
                %semantics
                  %mrow
                    %mi E
                  %annotation{:encoding => "application/x-tex"} E
              is
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/isomorphism"} isomorphic
              to the
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/pullback+bundle"} pullback bundle
              %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "inline", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
                %semantics
                  %mrow
                    %msup
                      %mi q
                      %mo *
                    %mi E
                    %mo ′
                  %annotation{:encoding => "application/x-tex"} q^\ast E'
              of a topological vector bundle
              %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "inline", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
                %semantics
                  %mrow
                    %mi E
                    %mo ′
                    %mo →
                    %mi X
                    %mo{:stretchy => "false"} /
