            %p This proves the claim.
            %p Alternatively, we may again argue directly from the long exact sequence:
            %p Consider the subspace inclusion
            .maruku-equation
              %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "block", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
