                    %mi U
                    %mi 𝒦
                %annotation{:encoding => "application/x-tex"}
                  B U_{\mathcal{K}} \coloneqq U(\mathcal{H})/U_{\mathcal{K}}
          %p
            is a model for the
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/classifying+space"} classifying space
            of reduced K-theory.
          %h3#of_noncompact_spaces Of non-compact spaces
          %p
            For
            %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "inline", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
              %semantics
                %mrow
                  %mi G
                %annotation{:encoding => "application/x-tex"} G
