            is a choice of
            %em complex orientation
            (
            %a{:href => "complex+oriented+cohomology+theory#ComplexOrientedCohomologyTheory"}> this def.
            ).
          %p
            Now for
            %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "inline", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
              %semantics
